5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the ground shifting under the diggers. We need to know what the soil can actually handle.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The park is a living system. I want to see how people actually move through it on a normal day.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,Who is going to mow the grass and fix the fences? I am worried about the daily work.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,Pretty drawings lie. I want to see what the last projects look like after five years of rain.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I am quiet, but I count the coins. I need to know the long-term cost of keeping this place alive.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, do you think the paths will hold up if the ground is soft?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, only if we respect the drainage. I am checking the crossing patterns to be sure.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I will look at who is already helping out. It feels safer if we have friends there.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I am looking at the old works. If the apron cracked, the new one might too.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I will check the upkeep ledger. I need to see the real numbers, not the promises.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I am also checking the firms. If only two can dig, we are in trouble.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will also look at the drainage records. Heat and water are the real enemies here.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will check the volunteer groups. They seem very dedicated and kind.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I will also check the planting records. If the trees died, the new ones might too.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will also check the habitat fund terms. I need to know what money is actually available.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Let us see what the ground tells us.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic over emotion, please.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we find a good team.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,Facts will guide us.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,The budget must survive the ribbon cutting.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
