60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Plan A, the Wetland, fits the phasing notes. We can keep the park open while we build.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Plan A addresses the heat and drainage. The boardwalks give firm ground for the crossings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,Plan A uses the volunteer groups for habitat tasks. It feels right for the community.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,Plan A is simple water management. The basin worked. This is similar.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,Plan A is fully funded by the habitat fund. The other plans will drain the city's coffers.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, do the boardwalks solve the crossing issue?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, yes. They provide the firm ground people want, without blocking the water.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Minako, are you sure the water won't get messy?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, reed beds are self-cleaning. It is better than the cracked apron.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@All, the financial case for A is the strongest. The others are liabilities.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I am convinced. The earth-moving risk is manageable with phasing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,The logic holds. It respects the site's natural behavior.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I am happy. The volunteers will love the habitat work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,It is the only plan that has survived the test of time in our records.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,It is the only plan that does not bankrupt us in three years.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Kenji,,Let us vote for A.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I agree.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I agree too.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,I agree.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
